    "cvrf:DocumentNotes": {
      "cvrf:Note": [
        {
          "#text": "An improper neutralization of special elements used in an OS command ('OS Command Injection') vulnerability [CWE-78] in FortiManager fgfmd daemon may allow a remote attacker impersonating a fortimanager cluster node to execute unauthorized code or commands via specially crafted packets. Impersonation of a Fortimanager cluster node requires possessing the node's certificate and private key.",
